+*   **Deformation MLP ($g_{\theta}^{(t)}$):** A Multi-Layer Perceptron mapping $\mathbb{R}^3 \to \mathbb{R}^3$ [S1, unofficial]. It takes a canonical point as input and outputs a displacement vector [G].
 
